{"ts":"2026-08-11T06:14:39.604Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"f016837593b4e6bc7293988d","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-5y05kq","claim:pm-7nqo6b","claim:pm-gjjurs","claim:pm-j1r8gl","lineage:pm-gjjurs","lineage:pm-5t33or","lineage:pm-n7rr","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-5y05kq+pm-7nqo6b+pm-gjjurs+pm-j1r8gl","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-5y05kq","claim:pm-7nqo6b","claim:pm-gjjurs","claim:pm-j1r8gl","lineage:pm-gjjurs","lineage:pm-5t33or","lineage:pm-n7rr","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-08-11T06:14:39.604Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Implementation correction from live UX review: the first lifecycle projection rendered nested rows and was too long for a standard terminal. The revised default flattens every type row into one canonical TOON table with columns type,total,open,in_progress,blocked,draft,closed,canceled,other; by_type is now the table itself rather than a wrapper, and omitted_zero_buckets is one scalar as required. Live repository proof after build: 22 non-empty lines and 564 bytes versus the rejected 134-line JSON-equivalent nested shape. The default still carries the full lifecycle split and --include-empty remains the explicit zero-fill restoration path. A focused strict TOON round-trip/projection test passes; a release token/line ceiling will make this screen-sized contract non-regressing."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-11T06:14:39.604Z"}],"before_hash":"ca5784b4d9b0eafe55ccaa3253e1ff4fae299cb3bc666b2adb991e56672f1f56","after_hash":"40c3ad71d1240c51e1456ac690d55eef913f3253882d6b9d09410dd88f08f225"}
